					</li>
					<li class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<span
							class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold font-mono shrink-0"
							>3</span
						> Accurate Neighboring Shadow Analysis
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<span
							class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold font-mono shrink-0"
							>4</span
						> 4K & Vertical (9:16) Batch Shadow Motion
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<span
							class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold font-mono shrink-0"
							>5</span
						> Architectural Presentation Boards
					</li>
				</ol>
			</div>
			<div
				class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 mt-6 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"
			>
				Compatible with standard SketchUp scenes and presentation export
				tools.
